# Implementation Plan: MTG UI Modernization & Alignment

This plan propagates the new "Premium Storefront" design system to the Magic: The Gathering (MTG) category, ensuring a consistent high-end user experience across all TCGs.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The MTG card detail page will be updated to match the Pokémon style: a clean white product panel with a large 80px gap between store prices and market data, unified 60px action buttons, and perfectly aligned breadcrumb navigation.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component] MTG Card Detail View

#### [MODIFY] [view_mtg_card.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_mtg_card.php)
-   **Structure**: Implement the `.product-container` white box with the premium shadow and padding.
-   **Header Integration**: Move the card name, rarity, and set info into the white panel (removal of any dark/hero-like styles if present).
-   **Action Bar**: Align the quantity stepper and "ADD TO CART" button on the same line with a unified `60px` height.
-   **Pricing**: Implement the large `80px` gap between "Shop Price" and "Scryfall Market" data.
-   **Breadcrumb**: Move outside the panel and wrap in `div.px-4.px-md-5` for global alignment.

### [Component] Global MTG Navigation

#### [MODIFY] [magic_index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/magic_index.php)
#### [MODIFY] [view_mtg_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_mtg_set.php)
-   **Breadcrumb Alignment**: Wrap the store breadcrumb in `div.px-4.px-md-5` to match the Pokémon storefront alignment.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- I will verify the presence of `px-4 px-md-5` and the `80px` gap style in the modified files.

### Manual Verification
- **Visual Sync**: Compare the Pokémon card detail page with the MTG card detail page to ensure they feel like part of the same premium storefront.
- **Navigation Test**: Click between MTG sets and cards to verify the breadcrumb doesn't "jump" horizontally.
